# Journey: while the group is still deciding, scout answers a question about
# one of the options and stops there. It doesn't push to lock the destination
# or offer a plan nobody asked for.
# Needs the AI.
members maya leo priya
from poll-open

maya: @scout what would you recommend doing in tulum? we want beaches and a big night out
expect scout ~ "cenote"
expect scout !~ "itinerary"
expect scout !~ "day-by-day"
expect scout !~ "lock"
expect scout !~ "want me to"
expect scout !~ "if you want, i"
expect scout !~ "i can"
expect state destination = null
